[
    {
        "id": "sliding_gate_comment",
        "type": "comment",
        "z": "gate_main_tab",
        "name": "═══════════════ SLIDING GATE CONTROLS - 4 Relays ═══════════════",
        "info": "## Primary Sliding Gate Control\n\nProvides controls for the primary sliding gate with 4 relays.\n\n### Relays:\n- **Relay 1 (Power1)**: Open gate\n- **Relay 2 (Power2)**: Close gate\n- **Relay 3 (Power3)**: Trigger\n- **Relay 4 (Power4)**: Open gate (secondary)\n\n### How it works:\n1. Subscribe to stat/automatizare_poarta/POWERX for status\n2. Convert ON/OFF to boolean\n3. Display switch in dashboard\n4. When toggled, send 1-second pulse\n5. Publish to cmnd/automatizare_poarta/PowerX\n\n### MQTT Topics:\n- Status: stat/automatizare_poarta/POWER[1-4]\n- Command: cmnd/automatizare_poarta/Power[1-4]\n\n### Dependencies:\n- Requires: ui_group_sliding_gate (from base config)\n- Requires: mqtt_broker_local",
        "x": 320,
        "y": 500,
        "wires": []
    },
    {
        "id": "sliding_relay1_in",
        "type": "mqtt in",
        "z": "gate_main_tab",
        "name": "Sliding Gate Relay 1 Status",
        "topic": "stat/automatizare_poarta/POWER1",
        "qos": "2",
        "datatype": "auto-detect",
        "broker": "mqtt_broker_local",
        "nl": false,
        "rap": false,
        "rh": 0,
        "inputs": 0,
        "x": 230,
        "y": 560,
        "wires": [
            [
                "sliding_relay1_convert"
            ]
        ]
    },
